#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:83
msgid "Нормальное состояние"
msgstr "Normal state"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:87
msgid "customConditional запретил показ"
msgstr "customConditional prevented display"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:91
msgid "Logic скрыла компонент"
msgstr "Logic hid the component"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:95
msgid "Оба механизма скрывают"
msgstr "Both mechanisms hide"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:97
msgid "``undefined``"
msgstr "``undefined``"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:99
msgid "formiojs ещё не инициализировал _visible"
msgstr "formiojs has not yet initialized _visible"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:101
msgid ""
"DOM обновляется только при наличии ``element`` и отличии "
"``shouldBeHidden`` от текущего состояния атрибута ``hidden``:"
msgstr "The DOM updates only if ``element`` exists and ``shouldBeHidden`` differs from the current ``hidden`` attribute state:"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:103
msgid ""
"Если ``shouldBeHidden === true``, устанавливаются атрибут ``hidden``, "
"``visibility: hidden`` и ``position: absolute``. Эта ветка применяется и "
"внутри Columns."
msgstr "If ``shouldBeHidden === true``, ``hidden``, ``visibility: hidden`` and ``position: absolute`` are set. This branch also applies within Columns."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:104
msgid ""
"Если ``shouldBeHidden === false`` и компонент находится в Columns с "
"``autoAdjust``, устанавливаются ``visibility: hidden`` и ``position: "
"relative``. Эта ветка не снимает атрибут ``hidden``."
msgstr "If ``shouldBeHidden === false`` and the component is in Columns with ``autoAdjust``, ``visibility: hidden`` and ``position: relative`` are set. This branch does not remove ``hidden``."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:105
msgid ""
"В остальных случаях показа атрибут ``hidden`` снимается, устанавливаются "
"``visibility: visible`` и ``position: relative``."
msgstr "In other display cases, ``hidden`` is removed and ``visibility: visible`` and ``position: relative`` are set."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:107
msgid ""
"Таким образом, таблица описывает вычисляемый признак скрытия, а не "
"гарантирует итоговую видимость элемента во всех режимах компоновки."
msgstr "The table therefore describes the calculated hiding flag, not guaranteed final visibility in every layout mode."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:110
msgid "Тестирование логики видимости"
msgstr "Testing Visibility Logic"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:112
msgid ""
"Функция ``applyCheckboxVisibility`` вынесена как именованный экспорт из "
"``Checkbox.js``, что позволяет тестировать её без рендеринга полного "
"компонента:"
msgstr ""
"The ``applyCheckboxVisibility`` function is exported as a named export "
"from ``Checkbox.js``, allowing it to be tested without rendering the full"
" component:"

